},"charspan":[0,395],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/17","text":"Students must read the assigned material before engaging in discussion and must contribute as much as possible to the in-class discussions. Each student is likely to find considerable benefit in the exchange of ideas, doubts, and criticisms during discussions. Much of the value of a graduate class is in the sharing of the knowledge and perspective that each participant brings to the sessions."},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"section_header","level":1,"orig":"Final Exam:","parent":{"$ref":"#/body"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":332.68258181818146,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":72.05136000000016,"r":135.89568000000014,"t":342.2611199999996},"charspan":[0,11],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/18","text":"Final Exam:"},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"text","orig":"A final exam will be distributed during the final class session. The exam will cover all readings assigned for the class, as well as material discussed in class.","parent":{"$ref":"#/body"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":301.4747529230766,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":72.05136000000016,"r":535.0457760000003,"t":323.7801599999996},"charspan":[0,161],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/19","text":"A final exam will be distributed during the final class session. The exam will cover all readings assigned for the class, as well as material discussed in class."},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"section_header","level":1,"orig":"Analytical Paper:","parent":{"$ref":"#/body"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":276.76498181818147,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":72.05136000000013,"r":160.3680480000001,"t":286.3435199999996},"charspan":[0,17],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/20","text":"Analytical Paper:"},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"text","orig":"Students will prepare an analytical paper about an international topic of their choice. The paper will model an outstanding form of analytical writing as discussed in class. It will be 5-7 pages (double-spaced) and will examine and evaluate a contemporary international issue from a particular theoretical perspective and level of analysis. The final paper will be due on November 10 via Canvas.","parent":{"$ref":"#/body"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":220.12978181818153,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":72.0513600000001,"r":541.9799999999998,"t":267.8625599999996},"charspan":[0,395],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/21","text":"Students will prepare an analytical paper about an international topic of their choice. The paper will model an outstanding form of analytical writing as discussed in class. It will be 5-7 pages (double-spaced) and will examine and evaluate a contemporary international issue from a particular theoretical perspective and level of analysis. The final paper will be due on November 10 via Canvas."},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"section_header","level":1,"orig":"Grading:","parent":{"$ref":"#/body"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":195.5326618181815,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":72.0513600000001,"r":121.01376000000009,"t":205.1111999999997},"charspan":[0,8],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/22","text":"Grading:"},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"text","orig":"This is a letter-graded course: A, B, C, D, or F. The standard grade scale will apply: 90%-100% = A; 80%-89% = B; 70%-79% = C; 60%-69% = D; below 60% = F.","parent":{"$ref":"#/body"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":164.32483292307666,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":72.05136000000005,"r":518.6878079999999,"t":186.63023999999973},"charspan":[0,154],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/23","text":"This is a letter-graded course: A, B, C, D, or F. The standard grade scale will apply: 90%-100% = A; 80%-89% = B; 70%-79% = C; 60%-69% = D; below 60% = F."},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"text","orig":"Notice: Failure to meet assignment due dates could result in a grade of I (Incomplete) and may adversely impact Tuition Assistance and/or Financial Aid.","parent":{"$ref":"#/body"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":43.92451292307692,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":72.0,"r":537.6539519999997,"t":66.10847999999999},"charspan":[0,152],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/24","text":"Notice: Failure to meet assignment due dates could result in a grade of I (Incomplete) and may adversely impact Tuition Assistance and/or Financial Aid."},{"children":[],"content_layer":"furniture","label":"page_footer","orig":"3","parent":{"$ref":"#/body"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":21.84259292307695,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":303.24,"r":311.52,"t":31.30848000000003},"charspan":[0,1],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/25","text":"3"}],"version":"1.10.0"}